      "number": "1.1",
      "title": "Exemption for Residential Plots up to 2,400 sq.ft (+20% Tolerance)",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": "oc-exemption-2026-06:CHAPTER I",
      "order": 2,
      "text": "By Government Order No. NAE/118/MNU/2026 dated 5 June 2026 issued under Section 248 of the Greater Bengaluru Governance Act, 2024 (superseding the order dated 9 September 2025), standalone residential buildings on plots up to 2,400 sq.ft (223 sq.m, with up to +20 percent sital area tolerance for odd-dimensional plots) and height up to Ground plus 3 floors or Stilt plus 3 floors within Bengaluru South City Corporation are exempt from obtaining a separate Occupancy Certificate for BESCOM/BWSSB utility connections, provided the building is constructed in accordance with a sanctioned plan.",
